          "Item A: Should FR-U003 be amended to split 'Save' (IndexedDB) from 'Download' (file export), or should the Phase 2 definition remain as-is and Phase 5 add the persistent-store UX on top? The answer determines whether FR-U003 needs an immediate spec amendment or whether a new FR-U (e.g., FR-U032 'Save to local project store') is the right vehicle.",
          "Item E: Should the Mermaid emitter (FR-C006, currently absent) be pulled forward from Phase 4 to Phase 3, or deferred to Phase 4 as planned? OED-301 (truncation policy) gates golden-file tests but not implementation\u00e2\u20ac\u201ddoes Aaron consider OED-301 blocking for Phase 3 inclusion?",
