          "Item K (Turtle prefix usage): passing PREFIX_MAP to the N3.js Writer will produce duplicate @prefix declarations alongside the TBox prepend block (both declare the same prefix bindings). Is duplicate @prefix acceptable in the Turtle output, or should the TBox prepend be restructured to emit only non-Writer-declared prefixes?",
