                "excerpt": "| `CANONICAL_RESERVED_NAME_COLLISION` | A project-created term has an IRI matching the canonical reserved-name list (see \u00c2\u00a75.7.1). Emitted when a term with `ecm:source: ecm:project-created` has `id` matching any IRI in the \u00c2\u00a75.7.1 list. |"
              }
