            "claim": "`AddTermDialog.tsx` already has a duplicate-IRI check via `collectExistingIris(project)`, implemented in two places: a submit-time hard block in `handleSubmit()` (lines 77-80, sets error state) and an inline render-time warning (lines 97-100 / 146-154 / 167, shows `gw-iri-duplicate-warning` and disables submit button). Neither check tests against canonical reserved names \u00e2\u20ac\u201d `collectExistingIris()` only collects from `ecm:terms` and `ecm:instances`, so canonical names (not in those arrays) would never be caught by the existing check.",
