          "ecm:system-starter-example source exemption: the check strictly matches ecm:source === 'ecm:project-created' per SPEC section 17.2 row. Terms with ecm:source: ecm:system-starter-example are currently exempt (no finding). Confirm whether system-starter-example terms with canonical IRIs are intended to be exempt or should also trigger the error.",
