        "summary": "handleNew() in App.tsx (lines 101-106) is a synchronous 4-line function with no dialog: it calls buildNewDocument() \u00e2\u20ac\u201d which sets iao:isAbout to [\"ecm:UnspecifiedSubjectMatter\"] \u00e2\u20ac\u201d and immediately sets project state. The post-creation nag is a banner (lines 291-310) with a CTA that opens the existing ProjectSettingsDialog; no blocking wizard exists. FR-U001 (SPEC.md:1325) uses SHOULD + MAY-defer, making block-at-creation vs nag-after-creation an implementation-determined choice. The canvas double-click handler (CanvasView.tsx handlePaneClick, lines 233-311) immediately creates an ecm:Instance with ecm:classIris: [] and calls onProjectChange with no dialog and no class selection step. FR-U011 (SPEC.md:1335) uses MUST for class-picker prompting when owl:Class terms exist in the project. No NewProjectDialog, ClassPickerDialog, or analogous component exists in src/ui/. The Dialog primitive (Dialog.tsx) uses native <dialog>/showModal with a mount/unmount pattern and is reused by all five existing dialogs. Three Playwright tests assert dblclick \u00e2\u2020\u2019 immediate node count change without a dialog step (canvas.spec.ts Chain B AC2, Chain D AC4, smoke.spec.ts Smoke flow 1); of these, only Smoke flow 1 (which adds 'Person' before dblclicking) would activate FR-U011's MUST, because Chain B AC2 and Chain D AC4 both operate on projects with ecm:terms: [] (the FR-U011 class-less carve-out applies). Six Playwright tests assert gw-btn-new click \u00e2\u2020\u2019 gw-btn-save enabled without a dialog step. The two primary fixture files (canvas-3i-2r.jsonld, term-sidebar-2c-1op-1dp.jsonld) both have real iao:isAbout IRIs, so they are unaffected by any New-project wizard (wizard fires on New only per task context).",
        "evidence_paths": [
          "src/ui/App.tsx",
          "src/ui/CanvasView.tsx",
          "src/ui/Dialog.tsx",
          "src/ui/AddTermDialog.tsx",
          "src/ui/EditTermDialog.tsx",
          "src/ui/ProjectSettingsDialog.tsx",
          "src/ui/AddLiteralDialog.tsx",
          "src/ui/Inspector.tsx",
          "project/SPEC.md",
          "project/DECISIONS.md",
          "project/ROADMAP.md",
          "tests/playwright/new-open-save.spec.ts",
          "tests/playwright/canvas.spec.ts",
          "tests/playwright/smoke.spec.ts",
          "tests/playwright/isabout-ui.spec.ts",
          "tests/playwright/fixtures/canvas-3i-2r.jsonld",
