        ],
        "open_questions": [
          "S1-03 banner retention: If NewProjectDialog prevents the 'missing' isAboutState for new projects, the 'legacy' branch of the banner (App.tsx:300) still fires for opened v0.3 migrated files. Should the banner be retained solely for the 'legacy' case while removing the 'missing' branch, or should a unified design decision cover both cases?",
          "S1-02 dialog dismissibility: If the NewProjectDialog is dismissible (Escape or X button) without setting a subject, should handleNew() proceed with buildNewDocument() (ecm:UnspecifiedSubjectMatter default, banner fires) or should it abort (no project created)? The answer determines whether isabout-ui.spec.ts AC1 and smoke.spec.ts flow 4 remain valid test flows or need to be redesigned.",
          "S1-04 scope: The three other mutation callbacks (TermSidebar onTermsChange, CanvasView onProjectChange, Inspector onProjectChange) similarly omit setValidationReport. Are these in scope for the S1-04 fix, or is only the onSave path targeted?",
