        "summary": "16 changes across 6 files implementing all 4 atomic items: S1-02 (NewProjectDialog.tsx new component + App.tsx handleNew refactor, C1\u00e2\u20ac\u201cC4+C7), S1-03 (red banner removed \u00e2\u2020\u2019 muted soft-guidance for both missing and legacy, C5+C8), S1-04 (setValidationReport added to all setProject call-sites: onSave + three component callbacks, C6+C7), and test updates (C9\u00e2\u20ac\u201cC16: new-open-save AC2 + S1-04 test, smoke flows 1+4, isabout-ui AC1\u00e2\u20ac\u201cAC4). The handleAcknowledge path is deliberately excluded from C6's validate-on-change pattern because it manages acknowledged state independently and calling validate() there would wipe acknowledged flags. The awaiting_operator_decision path was not triggered; estimated JSON output is well within the 25000-char threshold.",
