            "claim": "The VMP_CONTEXT constant in canonicalize.ts declares `iao:isAbout` with `@type: @id, @container: @set` \u00e2\u20ac\u201d as a plain IRI-typed set property \u00e2\u20ac\u201d with no `@id` alias binding to redirect the property to a different IRI.",
            "evidence": [
