            "id": "F5",
            "claim": "`iao:OntologyDesignPattern` appears as a literal string in six source locations: the TBox Turtle block, getProjectTBoxNodes(), SEMANTIC_TYPE_ALLOWLIST, TBOX_IDS, the v0.3\u00e2\u2020\u2019v0.4 migration leg, and buildNewDocument() in App.tsx.",
            "evidence": [
