        "summary": "Continuation output C38-C63 (26 changes). Covers: vmp-serializer PBT constant (C38); semantic-projection BASE_PROJECT type + AC4 block 4-part update + TBox ids (C39-C44); emitters JSDoc + type + pass message (C45-C47); legacy-migration JSDoc + V04 type (C48-C49); normalize-on-load NON_CANONICAL_DOC type reversal (C50); 5 small test fixture type arrays (C51-C55); SPEC.md \u00c2\u00a75.2 prefix removal + iao:isAbout alias + prose note + \u00c2\u00a75.4 type desc + example + \u00c2\u00a75.14 TBox block + Notes bullet (C56-C62); DECISIONS.md ADR-007 (C63). Combined with prior output C1-C37 this completes the full Round 3 Chain delta IAO IRI fix end-to-end. All touchpoints from recon F1-F23 are addressed.",
