          "src/validate/index.ts: MISSING_REALIST_ANCHOR check stays on 'iao:isAbout' key (since option \u03b1 preserves the alias). Verify the check logic is key-based, not IRI-resolution-based",
          "src/ui/App.tsx: buildNewDocument keeps 'iao:isAbout' property key (option \u03b1); the 'type' array changes from ['ecm:Project', 'iao:OntologyDesignPattern'] to ['ecm:Project', 'ecm:OntologyDesignPattern']",
