        "bankings": [
          {
            "id": "B1",
            "category": "pattern-observation",
            "content": "The \u00ce\u00b4-1 / \u00ce\u00b4-2 split \u00e2\u20ac\u201d where \u00ce\u00b4-1 updates canonical docs and test fixtures but leaves source files unchanged, and \u00ce\u00b4-2 lands the source changes \u00e2\u20ac\u201d creates a temporary 'partial migration' state in which updated tests assert behavior that the source has not yet implemented (F4: TBox-bonus section expects ecm:OntologyDesignPattern but getProjectTBoxNodes() still returns iao:OntologyDesignPattern, causing 125/126). This state is structurally safe under the reconnaissance\u00e2\u2020\u2019ratification discipline because reconnaissance maps the full gap before the developer proposes any fix; the failing test serves as a precise specification of what \u00ce\u00b4-2 must deliver. The pattern is sound but requires the operator to hold the chain: do not apply \u00ce\u00b4-1 docs-and-tests without queuing \u00ce\u00b4-2 source immediately after, or the test suite remains red between passes."
          },
          {
            "id": "B2",
            "category": "methodology-refinement-candidate",
            "content": "The developer's 'uncertain' self-assessment on C8a/b/c and C9 (tbox-bundle.test.ts and new-open-save.spec.ts) exposes a constraint-language ambiguity in INPUTS: 'do NOT modify tests (those are \u00ce\u00b4-1 work; already done)' was interpreted by the developer as covering all test files, including tests that \u00ce\u00b4-1 was supposed to update but did not. The correct interpretation \u00e2\u20ac\u201d limiting the constraint to tests actually modified in \u00ce\u00b4-1 \u00e2\u20ac\u201d is the only reading that allows the full test suite to pass, but it required the developer to flag the ambiguity explicitly rather than act confidently. Future INPUTS constraints should distinguish 'tests already updated by \u00ce\u00b4-N' (do not re-modify) from 'tests that are stale and need updating in \u00ce\u00b4-N+1' (must update to restore green suite)."
          }
        ]
      },
