            "describe": "Not modified but should be re-run: after S4-02 the term sidebar on a new project will show 3 owl:Class entries (owl:Class, owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:ObjectProperty), 5 owl:ObjectProperty entries, 4 owl:DatatypeProperty entries \u00e2\u20ac\u201d all with 'starter' badge. Existing fixture-based tests are unaffected (Open flow does not inject starter terms)."
