          "Curate ~15-20 terms per recon's list: RDFS properties (label, comment, domain, range, subClassOf, subPropertyOf, seeAlso, isDefinedBy) + OWL properties (sameAs, differentFrom, equivalentClass, equivalentProperty, inverseOf). XSD datatypes are NOT in this list (separate concern).",
