            "evidence": "src/validate/starter-terms.ts:59-67 (rdfs:domain typed owl:ObjectProperty); :86-95 (rdfs:range typed owl:ObjectProperty); :104-120 (rdfs:subClassOf, rdfs:subPropertyOf typed owl:ObjectProperty); :153-197 (five OWL built-ins typed owl:ObjectProperty). RDFS Specification Section 3: rdfs:domain rdf:type rdf:Property; rdfs:range rdf:type rdf:Property; rdfs:subClassOf rdf:type rdf:Property; rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:type rdf:Property.",
            "correction": "Remove all 9 entries from STARTER_TERMS. No correct reclassification exists for the 4 RDFS meta-properties \u00e2\u20ac\u201d rdf:Property is not representable as any of owl:Class | owl:ObjectProperty | owl:DatatypeProperty | owl:AnnotationProperty without misrepresentation. The 5 OWL built-ins (owl:sameAs, owl:differentFrom, owl:equivalentClass, owl:equivalentProperty, owl:inverseOf) are built-in OWL axiom predicates that must not appear as user-selectable domain relations in ecm:terms."
