            "correction": "Namespace dropdown options (corrected list): [{ prefix: 'ex', ns: 'http://example.org/' }, { prefix: 'foaf', ns: 'http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/' }, { prefix: 'schema', ns: 'https://schema.org/' }]. Remove rdf: from the list. An 'advanced' namespace entry mode may allow free-text namespace input for expert users. Add ex:, foaf:, and schema: to the PREFIX_MAP in src/emit/turtle.ts:33-41 (foaf: and schema: are currently absent) so composed IRIs serialize with short-form prefixes."
