            "evidence": "demo/FEEDBACK-ROUND-4.md:59 (Target Data Type Dropdown spec). project/SPEC.md lines 763-764 (\u00c2\u00a77.1: rdfs:range not exported in v0.3). project/SPEC.md lines 784-785 (\u00c2\u00a77.5: domain and range deferred). OWL 2 Structural Specification Section 9.3: owl:DatatypeProperty rdfs:range must be a DataRange (XSD datatype or OWL datatype expression).",
