            "claim": "VERDICT confirm-aaron-correct on F16. The JSON payload shape {propertyType, namespace, prefix, localName, label:{text, lang}, range} is ontologically well-formed. The namespace + localName decomposition correctly models IRI construction. The label:{text, lang} structure correctly models rdf:langString. The range field as XSD IRI for DatatypeProperty and null/absent for AnnotationProperty correctly reflects the ontological distinction. No ontological issues with the proposed shape.",
