            "correction": "No ontological correction needed. The payload shape is a structural implementation decision that follows directly from the ontological requirements surfaced in S8-S12. The semantic mapping is: composed IRI = namespace + localName; 'rdfs:label' = label.text with language tag = label.lang; 'rdfs:range' = range (IRI string or null)."
