            "evidence": "src/projection/index.ts:29-39 (SEMANTIC_TYPE_ALLOWLIST \u00e2\u20ac\u201d owl:AnnotationProperty absent; annotation property terms dropped). src/emit/turtle.ts:175-178 (rdf:type emitted from type field \u00e2\u20ac\u201d correct once terms reach this code). src/emit/turtle.ts:202-210 (rdfs:label emitted as plain literal \u00e2\u20ac\u201d language tag missing). demo/FEEDBACK-ROUND-4.md:79-87 (target Turtle with language-tagged label).",
