            "rationale": "Update \u00a729 Phase 2 delivery bullet from 'three term types' to 'four term types' with explicit enumeration. Covers R4-TYPESYS-2 \u00a729 portion (recon F8, F9, F18).",
            "before": "- term sidebar (three term types);",
