        "output_envelope_constraint": "Output wrapped: outputs.findings[], outputs.summary, outputs.recommendation.",
        "goal": "Review the proposed SPEC.md amendments + ADR drafts for ontological correctness. Particular focus: \u00a77.1/\u00a77.5 rdfs:range constraint language; ADR-009 rationale; annotation-vs-datatype distinction in \u00a76.1; canonical IRIs cited in \u00a75.7 for built-in annotation properties.",
