        "summary": "The BLOCKING fix batch (SA1 + SA3) touches six code locations and three test files. SA3 root: `SEMANTIC_TYPE_ALLOWLIST` in `src/projection/index.ts:29-39` omits `owl:AnnotationProperty`, causing silent drop. SA1 root: `EcmTermType` union (`src/validate/starter-terms.ts:13-16`) and `AddTermType` union (`src/ui/AddTermDialog.tsx:17-20`) each lack `owl:AnnotationProperty`, and `STARTER_TERMS` has 16 entries (4 owl:DatatypeProperty, 9 owl:ObjectProperty, 3 owl:Class meta) where 12 need removal and 4 need reclassification to `owl:AnnotationProperty`. `TermSidebar.tsx` `partitionTerms()` returns 3 buckets and renders 3 sections \u00e2\u20ac\u201d a 4th Annotation Properties bucket and TermSection are missing. For SA4 (`rdfs:seeAlso` IRI emission): `rdfs:seeAlso` is entirely absent from `nodeToQuads()` in `src/emit/turtle.ts` (neither in the IRI-valued loop at lines 191-199 nor the string-literal loop at lines 202-211), but it is also absent from `SEMANTIC_PREDICATE_ALLOWLIST` in `projection/index.ts:55-76` \u00e2\u20ac\u201d meaning it would be stripped by projection before ever reaching the Turtle emitter; SA4 requires fixes in both files. Two spec test failures are guaranteed post-fix: `tests/starter-terms.test.ts` AC1 (`>= 15` threshold, line 47) and AC3 VALID_TYPES set (line 36-39) both need updating. Two open conflicts: (1) the decomposition document claims `rdfs:seeAlso` is already in the turtle.ts string-literal list, but the current code does not contain it; (2) R4-STARTER-5 says remove `rdfs:isDefinedBy` but the R4-1-amended SPEC \u00c2\u00a75.7 lists it as one of the 4 canonical `owl:AnnotationProperty` starter terms.",
