            "rationale": "Update AC3 error message string to include owl:AnnotationProperty in the list of valid types, matching the updated VALID_TYPES set.",
            "before": "      `entry[${i}]: type must be owl:Class|owl:ObjectProperty|owl:DatatypeProperty; got \"${t.type}\"`,",
