            "correction": "Remove the 'seeAlsoVal.includes(\":\")' arm from the isIri condition. Replace with explicit scheme-prefix matching only: const isIri = seeAlsoVal.startsWith('http://') || seeAlsoVal.startsWith('https://') || seeAlsoVal.startsWith('urn:') || seeAlsoVal.startsWith('ftp://') || seeAlsoVal.startsWith('mailto:'); For CURIE-style values (e.g., 'owl:Thing'), the caller should pre-expand via expandIri() and check whether the result differs from the input before deciding between namedNode and literal; however, CURIEs in rdfs:seeAlso position are unusual in practice and can be deferred. The minimal fix is removal of includes(':')."
