          "Should R4-4 introduce a NEW PropertyCreationDialog.tsx component and leave AddTermDialog.tsx for owl:Class and owl:ObjectProperty creation, OR should it refactor AddTermDialog.tsx to render the FR-U033 fields when the internal type toggle is AnnotationProperty/DatatypeProperty? The decomposition (R4-MINISPEC-1 completeness map) points to AddTermDialog.tsx as the mutation target, but does not explicitly resolve the cohabitation of Class/ObjectProperty creation paths in the same component.",
