            "correction": "Under Option gamma: in demo/library-catalog.jsonld, update the Book class entry to: { \"id\": \"urn:uuid:11111111-1111-4111-8111-cccccccc0001\", \"type\": \"owl:Class\", \"ecm:source\": \"ecm:project-created\", \"rdfs:label\": { \"text\": \"Book\", \"lang\": \"en\" }, \"rdfs:subClassOf\": [\"cco:ont00000064\"] }. The rdfs:subClassOf array is already in LEX_SORTED_ARRAY_KEYS so serializeVmp() will handle it correctly. Under Option alpha: replace the entry entirely with a cco:ont00000064 reference and update all ecm:classIris values from the local UUID to \"cco:ont00000064\" in the instances array.",
