        "editorial_hint": false,
        "purpose": "Pass 2a ratification per FNSR Spec 03. Read developer's proposed changes from UPSTREAM. Walk reconnaissance UPSTREAM (recon agent in deps). Walk SME-374 UPSTREAM for the SME findings on this chain's items. Produce six-field ruling: ruling, editorial_verdict, editorial_verdict_reason, rationale, referenced_evidence, bankings.",
        "spec_refs": [
