      "attempts": 1,
      "outputs": {
        "ruling": "ratified",
        "editorial_verdict": "substantive",
        "editorial_verdict_reason": "The proposed change adds two new regex constants, two new React state variables, a conditional JSX block, an updated selectedNs derivation, and four new submit-guard branches to PropertyCreationDialog.tsx \u00e2\u20ac\u201d functional feature scope that extends the component's behavior, far beyond typo fixes, formatting adjustments, or terminology tightening.",
        "rationale": "Reconnaissance is present in UPSTREAM (urn:fnsr:task:375-recon-r5-c1), satisfying Spec 03 \u00c2\u00a7'Reconnaissance requirement' for substantive changes. SME findings for R5-A1a (urn:fnsr:task:374-sme-r5-decomposition, finding R5-A1a) establish three binding constraints: (1) namespace IRI validated by /^(https?:\\/\\/[^\\s]+[#\\/]|urn:[^\\s]+#)$/ (ends with '#' or '/'); (2) custom prefix label validated by /^[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_-]*$/ (NCName-compatible, underscore-start allowed); (3) LOCAL_NAME_RE must not be narrowed. The developer's implementation (urn:fnsr:task:376-dev-r5-c1, changes C1\u00e2\u20ac\u201cC7) was verified against the actual file via Read:\n\n\u00e2\u20ac\u00a2 C1 (header comment): before-snippet confirmed at line 9; after adds ', Custom...' to the field-(b) description. \u00e2\u0153\u201c\n\u00e2\u20ac\u00a2 C2 (regex constants): CUSTOM_NS_IRI_RE = /^(https?:\\/\\/[^\\s]+[#\\/]|urn:[^\\s]+#)$/ and CUSTOM_PREFIX_RE = /^[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_-]*$/ match the SME specification exactly; LOCAL_NAME_RE at line 74 is unchanged. \u00e2\u0153\u201c\n\u00e2\u20ac\u00a2 C3 (state variables): customNsIri and customPrefixLabel initialized to '' appended after submitError at line 117; neither is stored in the term record, consistent with SME R5-A1b (prefix labels carry no OWL 2 semantics). \u00e2\u0153\u201c\n\u00e2\u20ac\u00a2 C4 (selectedNs derivation): isCustomPrefix derived at a single declaration point (selectedPrefix === 'custom'); selectedNs branches on isCustomPrefix so composedIri and the duplicate-IRI check (lines 127\u00e2\u20ac\u201c128) both use the correct custom IRI value. Derived booleans customNsIriValid and customPrefixLabelValid use a soft-validation pattern (true when field is empty; false only on invalid non-empty input), consistent with the existing localNameValid and langTagValid conventions. Before-snippet confirmed at lines 119\u00e2\u20ac\u201c129. \u00e2\u0153\u201c\n\u00e2\u20ac\u00a2 C5 ('Custom...' sentinel): appended as last <option value='custom'> in the prefix select, after the NAMESPACE_OPTIONS.map; before-snippet confirmed at lines 231\u00e2\u20ac\u201c237. \u00e2\u0153\u201c\n\u00e2\u20ac\u00a2 C6 (conditional custom-input block): inserted between the Prefix selector's closing </label> (line 237) and the '(c) Local Name' comment (line 239), exactly at the natural insertion point identified by recon finding F6. JSX shows Namespace IRI and Prefix Label inputs with inline error paragraphs tied to the soft-valid booleans; before-snippet confirmed at lines 237\u00e2\u20ac\u201c243. IRI preview at lines 264\u00e2\u20ac\u201c268 requires no structural change (confirmed by recon F12). \u00e2\u0153\u201c\n\u00e2\u20ac\u00a2 C7 (submit guards): four custom-mode guards (IRI non-empty; IRI matches CUSTOM_NS_IRI_RE; label non-empty; label matches CUSTOM_PREFIX_RE) inserted after the BCP47 guard at lines 148\u00e2\u20ac\u201c151, before newTerm construction; block skipped entirely when isCustomPrefix is false, preserving all existing curated-prefix submit behavior. Before-snippet confirmed at lines 148\u00e2\u20ac\u201c152. \u00e2\u0153\u201c\n\nAll twelve recon findings (F1\u00e2\u20ac\u201cF12) are addressed. The change is confined to src/ui/PropertyCreationDialog.tsx (Layer 2), does not touch src/kernel/ (Layer 0), and introduces no kernel determinism violations. The 'custom' sentinel string is a magic value but is used consistently (derived at one point, assigned once in JSX); acceptable at minimal-change scope. Two acknowledged gaps are non-blocking: (a) tests_recommended (PropertyCreationDialog.test.tsx) are not included \u00e2\u20ac\u201d developer called this out explicitly in structured output; (b) the urn: branch in CUSTOM_NS_IRI_RE restricts to '#' only, not '/'; developer followed the SME spec rather than extending it unilaterally, which is the correct discipline.",
        "referenced_evidence": [
          {
            "type": "upstream_task",
            "id": "urn:fnsr:task:374-sme-r5-decomposition",
            "field": "outputs.findings[id=R5-A1a]"
          },
          {
            "type": "upstream_task",
            "id": "urn:fnsr:task:375-recon-r5-c1",
