        "purpose": "In src/emit/turtle.ts nodeToQuads(): when emitting rdf:type quads for non-TBox nodes, filter out ecm:Instance. The internal JSON-LD representation MUST be unchanged (projection layer + UI rely on it). Per SME R5-B5 verdict-note: tool-infrastructure class assertion has no domain ontology meaning and should not appear in consumer-facing export.",
        "files_in_scope": [
          "src/emit/turtle.ts"
        ],
        "sme_findings_source": "task 374 outputs.findings (UPSTREAM); filter by id matching this chain's item_ids",
        "constraint": "Produce minimal change set (changes[] with before/after); honor SME verdict_note constraints; ensure non-overlapping BEFORE-snippet regions (lesson from chain 1 C6 overlap)."
