            "content": "Reconnaissance F12 (unique-change-point finding) functioned as a surgical-scope establisher: by enumerating every rdf:type emission path in nodeToQuads() and verifying only one is reachable for instance nodes, it converted a potentially broad 'strip ecm:Instance from Turtle' instruction into a one-line guard with provable non-overlap against the parallel ecm:classIris loop. This is a reusable reconnaissance discipline pattern \u00e2\u20ac\u201d when a developer change is described as 'minimal', the reconnaissance task should explicitly enumerate alternative paths and assert non-existence rather than only confirming the targeted path."
