                  "rationale": "Events 4\u00e2\u20ac\u201c7 all surfaced at the same chain's verification step in rapid succession. Event 4 reveals that developer-produced Playwright test files are not automatically included in npm test, creating a structural gap between chain-machinery verification and AC coverage. Event 5 reveals that vite preview as webServer requires a pre-built dist that the test-runner command does not manage. Event 6 (also banked as bank-439) confirms Windows subprocess.run('npm') failure is a recurring risk. Event 7 reveals fixture encoding is not validated before Playwright runs. Each required operator-action recovery with no chain-machinery path, meaning every sprint with new Playwright tests carries this verification gap.",
