                  "rationale": "Round 3 Chain \u00ce\u00b3 landed ontology-vocabulary content in src/validate/starter-terms.ts. Because Spec 08 v0.2 dispatched semantic-sme review on file extension (.jsonld/.ttl/.owl), the TypeScript source file was not routed for SME review. The developer assigned owl:DatatypeProperty to rdfs:label/comment/seeAlso and included OWL/RDFS meta-vocabulary \u00e2\u20ac\u201d both classes of errors the SME would have caught. The two blocking defects (SA1, SA3) are a direct consequence. Spec 08 v0.3 corrects this by routing on content domain. This is a verification-scope-drift observation about the process gate that was absent.",
