              "state_admin.py:1680-1690 \u00e2\u20ac\u201d AP-PLO-2 hard refusal fires ONLY when the operator explicitly calls cmd_phase_close with from_state != drift-reconciled; there is NO substrate check that prevents starting Phase 4 work while Phase 3 is in po-satisfied state",
