        "phase": "phase-3",
        "chain_label": "Phase 3 Chain 1 \u2014 Turtle Import Core (sub-task 3.1)",
        "purpose": "Implement Phase 3 sub-task 3.1 per IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN. Create new src/import/turtle-import.ts module with importOntology(turtleSource, fileName, projectId) -> ImportResult. Use N3.js (already in package.json runtime deps; pattern established by src/emit/turtle.ts). Extract owl:Class, rdfs:Class (normalize to owl:Class), owl:ObjectProperty, owl:DatatypeProperty. Preserve rdfs:label, rdfs:comment, rdfs:subClassOf, rdfs:subPropertyOf verbatim. Produce ecm:ImportedOntology record per SPEC \u00a75.6 (id, type, ecm:projectId, ecm:name, ecm:sourceFileName, ecm:format: 'text/turtle', ecm:contentHash = 'sha256-' + SHA-256 of source bytes, ecm:content, ecm:createdAt, ecm:importStatus: 'ecm:parsed'). Hard-reject source > 50 MB BEFORE parsing per \u00a712.2. Do NOT follow owl:imports references per \u00a712.2. Kernel-pure: no Date.now() (caller supplies clock; same pattern as IRI generation), no Math.random(), no I/O, no DOM. Add a tests/import-turtle.test.ts with the 6 acceptance criteria from IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN \u00a73.1.",
