        "constraint": "Kernel purity per CLAUDE.md \u00a79 layer boundaries (src/import/ is Layer-0-equivalent; no DOM, no Date.now, no Math.random, no I/O). Deterministic: same input bytes -> same ImportResult. Acceptance criteria from IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN \u00a73.1 are the test plan. Honor 6 acceptance tests: (1) small.ttl produces >= 1 owl:Class; (2) rdfs:Class -> owl:Class normalization; (3) rdfs:subClassOf preserved; (4) ecm:contentHash = 'sha256-' + sha256; (5) 51MB rejected pre-parse; (6) owl:imports NOT followed."
