            "content": "The Phase 3 first-chain dispatch (recon\u00e2\u2020\u2019developer\u00e2\u2020\u2019ratification) demonstrates clean propagation of open questions across the chain: recon raised four open questions (browser compatibility, explicit clock/seed threading, sub-function decomposition, module placement); the developer's proposal resolved three (Node-only context inherited from manifest precedent; createdAt threading adopted; single index.ts barrel + turtle-import.ts adopted) and re-surfaced the remaining one (browser-context resolution) plus three \u00c2\u00a73.5-scope items (ecm:name derivation strategy; term-ordering deferral; cli-integration AC7 update). This pattern \u00e2\u20ac\u201d recon questions partially resolved by developer with the residual re-flagged for the next sub-task \u00e2\u20ac\u201d is the intended shape of the Pass 2a chain. Worth banking as a positive-pattern observation for Phase 3 chains 2\u00e2\u20ac\u201c6 to replicate."
