        ],
        "constraint": "Minimal targeted fix. Do NOT modify tests/import-turtle.test.ts or src/import/index.ts (they may be correct). Do NOT introduce new dependencies. Preserve all error handling and the SHA-256 contentHash logic. Per Spec 03 brief-confirmation: substantive ratification at 490-rat-p3-c1 covers the implementation approach; this is the editorial follow-up to land what 491's applier wrote but couldn't compile.",
