rvation: refusal-via-error-envelope produces a status=blocked task that the auto-stall-detector then recursively re-fixes, even though the structured error WAS the work product. Per Refusal contract intent, the audit-chain rejected_outputs should be terminal; the dispatch path should not re-enter.",
