ND prior Fixers' use of Path 2 prevented the awaiting_operator_decision surface from firing, so stall_detector + fixer-auto-dispatch kept compounding the queue by one Fixer+recovery-dispatcher pair per cycle. I diagnose successfully (Path 2's 'cannot diagnose' criterion does NOT apply); the recovery requires operator authority (Path 1 applies).",
