        "constraint": "Single new file. Follow existing tests/playwright/ patterns. Do NOT modify tests/playwright/term-crud.spec.ts -- the existing negative-invariant test stays as a regression guard.",
        "ft_anchor": "ft-778-dev-p3-c3-1"
