        "summary": "Phase 3 (Ontology Import and Term Management) delivered across four chains at build_ref=77ce8ed. Chain 1 (build_ref=8707ef0) fixed the N3.js parser in src/import/turtle-import.ts to use the synchronous overload, enabling importOntology() to extract terms from Turtle files (IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN \u00c2\u00a73.1, 6/6 ACs, 137 tests). Chain 2 replaced the ADR-003 Phase 1 stub with the real import-ontology CLI command in src/cli/index.ts (IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN \u00c2\u00a73.5, 2/2 ACs; tests/cli-import-ontology.test.ts added). Chain 3 sub-task A introduced src/kernel/remap-references.ts as a new pure kernel function satisfying IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN \u00c2\u00a73.2 AC3 (zero residual A-occurrences in ecm:classIris/ecm:predicateIri) and AC4 (ecm:ontologies preserved); tests/remap-references.test.ts covers 8 unit cases. Chain 3.2-UI (the final chain, build_ref=77ce8ed) completed the UI immutability surface across 4 sub-tasks: sub-task B wired an onImportedTermClick callback prop into TermSidebar.tsx (preserving aria-disabled and the existing negative-invariant Playwright test); sub-task D added a belt-and-suspenders null-return guard in EditTermDialog.tsx; sub-task C extended Inspector.tsx with a read-only selectedTermId mode (gw-inspector-imported-term, gw-inspector-term-imported-badge, gw-btn-remap), wired App.tsx state with mutual exclusion, and created the new RemapDialog.tsx component (gw-dialog-remap) backed by the remapReferences kernel; sub-task E added tests/playwright/imported-term-read-only.spec.ts with AC1 (fixture round-trip ecm:source preservation) and AC2 (click opens read-only Inspector) tests \u00e2\u20ac\u201d these run separately via npx playwright test, not npm test. Final gate: 148/148 npm tests across 20 files, exit_code=0. Key SPEC anchors: \u00c2\u00a713.3 (imported IRI immutability), \u00c2\u00a713.6 (remap workflow), FR-U010. ADR-003 discharged. No new ADRs created in Phase 3. Explicit deferrals: IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN \u00c2\u00a73.3 (