        "summary": "Initial demo doc for Phase 3 Chain 3.2-UI at build_ref=77ce8ed. Frames Chain 3.2-UI as the culminating Phase 3 chain that completes IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN section 3.2 acceptance criteria (AC1+AC2 via Playwright spec; AC3+AC4 via the Chain 3.A remap-references unit suite) by delivering imported-term immutability across TermSidebar, EditTermDialog, Inspector, and App.tsx plus a new RemapDialog component backed by the remapReferences kernel. Test gate at build_ref=77ce8ed: 148/148 npm tests across 20 files (exit_code=0); Playwright AC1+AC2 wired but run separately via npx playwright test (not substrate-verified in the audit chain). Sign-off prompt surfaces three PO-territory questions: in-browser Playwright confirmation, RemapDialog candidate-filter strictness, and Phase-3-chain-landing-vs-Exit-Gate framing (items 3/5/7/8/9/11 remain open). One file change; ASCII-only; cites only documented SPEC sections (13.3, 13.6), FR-U010, IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN sections (3.1/3.2/3.3/3.4/3.5), and ADR-003 (discharged in Chain 2). Doc total ~115 lines. No companion-doc amendments proposed.",
