        "chain_label": "Phase 3 Chain 4 sub-task B -- ImportOntologyDialog component",
        "purpose": "Sub-task B: src/ui/ImportOntologyDialog.tsx (new). Modeled on the RemapDialog pattern from Chain 3.2-UI. Component responsibilities: (1) file picker accepting .ttl files (mime type and extension filter; size hard-rejected at >50MB matching SPEC section 12.2); (2) on file selected, read as text via FileReader.readAsText (browser API); (3) invoke importOntology from src/import with the sha256HexAsync digest function from sub-task A; (4) display a preview of extracted terms (count of owl:Class / owl:ObjectProperty / owl:DatatypeProperty) before the user confirms; (5) on confirm, merge the ImportedOntologyRecord into project.ecm:ontologies and the augmented terms (ecm:source: ecm:imported-ontology + ecm:ontologyId) into project.ecm:terms, then close the dialog and return the new project to the parent (App.tsx); (6) on cancel, close without mutation; (7) test-id gw-dialog-import-ontology on the root; gw-import-file-input on the file picker; gw-btn-import-confirm + gw-btn-import-cancel on the buttons; gw-import-preview-count for the term-count preview. Use the existing project document type definitions from src/kernel/ -- the merge shape must match Chain 2's CLI cmdImportOntology behavior exactly. Note: JSON-LD ontology input is OUT of scope for this chain (deferred); the file picker rejects .jsonld with a clear message indicating Turtle only for v0.4.",
        "files_in_scope": [
