        "purpose": "Author stakeholder-facing demo doc for phase-3 chain at build_ref=0b3a424. Read reconnaissance findings from UPSTREAM. Produce a single changes[] entry creating demo/PHASE-3-chain-4-browser-import.md per the demo-doc-author agent contract. ASCII-only. Consumer audience (PO / stakeholder review).",
