            "claim": "rdfs:comment is captured at line 214 as a first-occurrence plain string (quad.object.value; lang tag not preserved), with the guard !termComments.has(subj). rdfs:label (line 209) captures { text, lang } with the same first-occurrence guard.",
            "evidence": [
