            "content": "The turtle-importer extension pattern is now five-step canonical: (1) declare IRI constant in the RDFS/SKOS namespace block; (2) declare typed Map alongside termTypes/termLabels/etc.; (3) add a capture branch in the quad-iteration loop with Literal guard + first-occurrence guard + lang fallback for language-tagged literals; (4) declare optional readonly field on ImportedTermObject; (5) declare the field on the local obj type annotation + add the conditional build-loop assignment in interface-field order. Sub-task A executes this pattern verbatim for two new SKOS predicates. Future importer extensions (FOAF properties, additional SKOS predicates like skos:altLabel, OWL2 facets) should follow the same five-step shape; deviation should require an explicit rationale."
          },
