            "id": "C3",
            "file": "src/ui/App.css",
            "rationale": "Add .gw-term-section-list (max-height: 12rem; overflow-y: auto) applied to the <ul> in TermSection to prevent unbounded list growth on large ontology imports (BFO/CCO). Add .gw-term-section-search and its :focus variant to style the per-section search input, matching the sidebar's existing aesthetic (same border/radius/font conventions as .gw-form-input but scaled down for the narrow sidebar). The 12rem max-height is one step above the 10rem established by .gw-iri-list (recon F18), giving each term section room for ~10 visible rows before scrolling. Inserted immediately after .gw-term-list within the Term Sidebar CSS block.",
            "before": ".gw-term-list {\n  list-style: none;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 0.25rem;\n}",
            "after": ".gw-term-list {\n  list-style: none;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.gw-term-section-list {\n  max-height: 12rem;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n}\n\n.gw-term-section-search {\n  width: 100%;\n  border: 1px solid #d1d5db;\n  border-radius: 3px;\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  padding: 0.25rem 0.375rem;\n  margin-bottom: 0.375rem;\n  outline: none;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  color: #1e293b;\n}\n\n.gw-term-section-search:focus {\n  border-color: #3b82f6;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);\n}",
            "scope": "minimal"
          }
        ],
