            "content": "The demo-doc sign-off prompt is emerging as the operational binding site for prior-chain architect bankings flagged as 'documentation gaps' or 'scope-drift'. Architect banking B2 on task 853-rat-p3-c5-B (IMPL \u00c2\u00a73.4 global-search vs per-section-search drift) was a non-blocking discipline-level observation at ratification time; the Polish-chain demo doc translates that banking into a discrete PO decision (Q2: pass/revise/pivot). Pattern: per-chain bankings flagged as scope-drift travel forward through the chain dispatch as audit residue, then surface as PO decision questions in the corresponding demo doc when the chain reaches demo-released. This formalizes a closure path for bankings that otherwise have no operational binding at activation time."
