        "open_questions": [
          "The ecm:importStatus type in ImportedOntologyRecord was widened to 'ecm:parsed' | 'ecm:degraded' by sub-task A. TypeScript will accept the spread-override in handleContinueDegraded only after sub-task A's changes are compiled. Verify npm run build passes after both sub-tasks are applied in order.",
          "turtle-import.ts always writes ecm:importStatus='ecm:parsed' on the ontology object it returns, even when warning='LARGE_IMPORT'. The dialog's handleContinueDegraded is solely responsible for producing the 'ecm:degraded' value via spread-override. Confirm no downstream consumer (CLI, validate/index.ts, snapshot tests) reads ecm:importStatus directly off the ImportResult.ontology object in a way that expects 'ecm:degraded' to already be set at parse time."
        ],
