          },
          {
            "file": "tests/playwright/large-import-virtualization.spec.ts",
            "describe": "Search + virtualize composition: with a degraded 500-term section, typing a search query that reduces filtered results to <=200 should deactivate virtualization (gw-term-section-virtualized absent) and show all matching items as a plain ul."
