        ],
        "open_questions": [
          "VIRT_ITEM_HEIGHT=28px is an estimate based on CSS (.gw-term-item padding + font line-height + flex gap). If the actual rendered row height differs (e.g., due to browser default font size != 16px), spacer sizes will be slightly inaccurate. The Playwright AC5 assertion (<=200 DOM nodes) is unaffected, but scrollbar accuracy degrades. A follow-up could measure the first rendered item height via ResizeObserver and feed it back into the calculation.",
          "virtContainerH is hard-coded as 192 (12rem * 16px). If the user's browser default font size is not 16px, or if .gw-term-section-list max-height is ever changed in CSS, this constant will diverge. A more robust approach would read the container's clientHeight via ref after first paint. Deferred for now; fix is a single constant update.",
          "The virtualized container uses a plain <div> with className='gw-term-section-list' (which has max-height: 12rem; overflow-y: auto in CSS) plus an inline height: 12rem override to make the height fixed rather than max. This is correct but the max-height/height coexistence may confuse future CSS edits. Consider adding a separate .gw-term-section-list--virtualized class in a follow-up App.css patch.",
          "IMPL section 3.4 (global search + scope filter, search-only navigation in degraded mode) is not addressed by this sub-task. The per-section search from Chain 5 is preserved; the interaction between global-search and per-section virtualization remains an open architecture question for Chain 7+ per recon finding F19."
        ],
        "summary": "Single-file change to src/ui/TermSidebar.tsx adding hand-rolled scroll-position windowing. Six sequential before/after patches: (C1) module-level VIRT_ITEM_HEIGHT/VIRT_OVERSCAN/VIRT_THRESHOLD constants + hasDegradedOntology helper; (C2) isDegraded prop + scrollTop state on TermSection; (C3) virtualization window parameter computation + renderTermItem helper extracted before the return; (C4) three-branch render (empty / virtualized / full-list) replacing the original unbounded map; (C5) isDegraded computation in TermSidebar; (C6) isDegraded={isDegraded} threaded to all four TermSection calls. When no degraded ontology or term count <= 200, behavior is identical to Chain 5. Virtualized path activates only when both conditions hold: at least one ecm:degraded ontology in the project AND the section's filteredTerms.length > 200.",
        "self_assessment": "confident"
      },
