            "content": "In-memory Buffer + setInputFiles is a clean Playwright fixture pattern for large synthetic inputs that don't merit a committed static file. The developer's generateLargeTurtle() + {name, mimeType, buffer} payload mirrors the inline 'a'.repeat() pattern used in tests/import-turtle.test.ts for SIZE_EXCEEDED (recon F15) and avoids both a multi-hundred-KB commit and a globalSetup hook. Worth surfacing in PLAYBOOK as the preferred pattern for large-fixture E2E tests."
          },
