            "content": "The developer's open_questions flagged a 'gw-term-item-class testid mismatch' with IMPL section 3.3 AC5; on inspection the IMPL text prescribes no per-type testid, only 'DOM node count for term list <= 200.' The discrepancy was an inferential misreading by the developer that the architect's ratification surface resolved. Pattern: developer open_questions citing IMPL/SPEC discrepancies should be cross-checked against the actual IMPL/SPEC text during ratification, not accepted as authoritative."
