        "purpose": "Author stakeholder-facing demo doc for phase-3 chain at build_ref=9b604b8. Read reconnaissance findings from UPSTREAM. Produce a single changes[] entry creating demo/PHASE-3-chain-6-large-import-degraded.md per the demo-doc-author agent contract. ASCII-only. Consumer audience (PO / stakeholder review).",
