            "rationale": "Extends the ecm:importStatus field documentation in section 5.6 from a single-value JSON example (ecm:parsed only) to an enumerated prose block naming both permitted values with semantic definitions. The TypeScript interface in src/import/turtle-import.ts already declares the union 'ecm:parsed' | 'ecm:degraded' (recon F3); IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN section 3.3 AC4 already names ecm:degraded as the acceptance criterion (recon F6); this amendment is documentation alignment only. No ADR citation is introduced: section 5.6 currently has zero ADR cross-references (recon F9) and the amendment requires none. All content is ASCII-only.",
            "before": "### 5.6 Imported Ontology Object\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"urn:uuid:ONTOLOGY_UUID\",\n  \"type\": \"ecm:ImportedOntology\",\n  \"ecm:projectId\": \"urn:uuid:PROJECT_UUID\",\n  \"ecm:name\": \"Imported Ontology\",\n  \"ecm:sourceFileName\": \"ontology.ttl\",\n  \"ecm:format\": \"text/turtle\",\n  \"ecm:contentHash\": \"sha256-...\",\n  \"ecm:content\": \"@prefix ...\",\n  \"ecm:createdAt\": \"2026-05-14T12:00:00Z\",\n  \"ecm:importStatus\": \"ecm:parsed\"\n}\n```\n\n`ecm:content` may be omitted if the ontology source is included as a separate artifact in a ZIP package.",
            "after": "### 5.6 Imported Ontology Object\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"urn:uuid:ONTOLOGY_UUID\",\n  \"type\": \"ecm:ImportedOntology\",\n  \"ecm:projectId\": \"urn:uuid:PROJECT_UUID\",\n  \"ecm:name\": \"Imported Ontology\",\n  \"ecm:sourceFileName\": \"ontology.ttl\",\n  \"ecm:format\": \"text/turtle\",\n  \"ecm:contentHash\": \"sha256-...\",\n  \"ecm:content\": \"@prefix ...\",\n  \"ecm:createdAt\": \"2026-05-14T12:00:00Z\",\n  \"ecm:importStatus\": \"ecm:parsed\"\n}\n```\n\n`ecm:content` may be omitted if the ontology source is included as a separate artifact in a ZIP package.\n\n`ecm:importStatus` is a closed enumeration with two permitted values:\n\n- `\"ecm:parsed\"`: normal import; the extracted term count is at or below `LARGE_IMPORT_THRESHOLD` (10,000 terms; see section 14.2).\n- `\"ecm:degraded\"`: the user selected \"Continue in degraded mode\" at the import warning dialog (IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN section 3.3 AC4); the ontology record is stored with partial extraction and search-only navigation applies. Defined in `src/import/turtle-import.ts` (`ImportedOntologyRecord`).",
